{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1646"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge literature/classics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/literature__classics.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1053],["+","\n\nAll of it was written at a desk in Saxony. May travelled to the Orient only in 1899–1900, and it was not until 1908, long after Winnetou, that he and his wife Klara made a six-week journey to the United States – and even then he got no further west than Albany, Buffalo and Niagara Falls."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",963],["+","\n\nAll das entstand an einem Schreibtisch in Sachsen. In den Orient reiste May erst 1899/1900, und erst 1908, lange nach Winnetou, unternahm er mit seiner Frau Klara eine sechswöchige Reise in die USA – und kam selbst da nicht weiter nach Westen als bis Albany, Buffalo und zu den Niagarafällen."]]}]},
